CONVOLUTION FACTOR-CAPTURE TILING PILOT
=======================================
HYP-2452/T796/OPEN-Q-074 addendum to HYP-2450 and HYP-2451.

SOURCE ANCHORS
==============
Singh arXiv:2411.18366: value factorizations bound polynomial factor complexity.
Iravanian arXiv:2410.15880: real-factor recombination as subset/trace assembly.
Abu Salem-Gao-Lauder: Newton polytope decomposition + boundary-to-interior factor lift.

